WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v John Smith>Good morning everyone, thanks for joining today's sync.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.000
<v Jane Doe>Morning! I have some updates on the project timeline.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:18.000
<v John Smith>Great, let's start with that. What's the current status?

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:28.000
<v Jane Doe>We've completed the initial design phase and are moving into development. Expected completion is end of next week.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:35.000
<v Mike Johnson>I have a question about the API integration. Do we have documentation ready?

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:42.000
<v Jane Doe>Yes, I'll share that in the chat right after this meeting. It includes all the endpoints we'll need.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:50.000
<v John Smith>Perfect. Mike, can you review that by end of day and let us know if anything's missing?

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:53.000
<v Mike Johnson>Absolutely, I'll get that done today.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:01:02.000
<v John Smith>Excellent. Any other blockers or concerns we should discuss?

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:08.000
<v Jane Doe>No blockers from my end. We're on track for the demo next Tuesday.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.000
<v John Smith>Great work everyone. Let's reconnect next week. Thanks all!
